      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i had the flu like 3 weeks ago and i thought i was over it but i still feel super wiped out. like even just walking up the stairs makes me really out of breath and my heart feels like it’s racing or thumping weird in my chest sometimes. is this just normal post-flu fatigue or should i be worried?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
